<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38153" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praevălĭdus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		praevaleo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>very strong</i> (not in Cic. or Cæs.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> Of persons: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">juvenis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 7,
					5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">legiones,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vell.
					2, 69, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cohortes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. H.
					2, 28</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> Of
			things: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">manus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. H.
					9, 80</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ramus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Vesp. 5</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>very strong</i>, <i>very powerful</i>, <i>prevailing</i>,
				<i>prevalent.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> Of persons, <i><span class="en">Tac. A. 3,
			35</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			Of things: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">urbes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					27, 39</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">neu (terra) se praevalidam primis ostendat
					aristis,</span>”
				<i>too strong</i>, <i>bearing too abundantly</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 2, 252</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nomina equitum,</span>”
				<i>great</i>, <i>imposing</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Tac.
					A. 12, 60 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praevalida et adulta vitia,</span>”
				<i>prevalent</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 3, 53</span></i>
			.—Hence, adv.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praevă-lĭdē</span></b> ,
				<i>very strongly</i> (post-Aug.), <i><span class="en">Plin. 17,
				14, 24, § 108</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
